{"version":1,"content":"<p>歷經二十多年研發，倍耐力正準備把其Cyber Tyre智能輪胎技術推廣到普通量產車型上，而不再局限於價格高昂的超級跑車。這套系統的核心，是一枚僅重13克的藍牙低功耗裝置。它被嵌入輪胎內襯，利用微機電系統傳感器感知橡膠狀態和路面情況，並把數據實時傳輸給車輛電腦。車輛據此調整防抱死制動系統、牽引力控制和駕駛輔助功能，從而提升行車安全。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588176.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:04:04.679133+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:50:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_hash":"6844e6d4d721d8e2f892cc42fc25af2e0144f318d792b4f9f7a24493c412e39c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}